[]($section.id("about"))

The Mathematics Colloquium in the department of Mathematics and Computer Science
at Rutgers-Newark takes place in 204 Smith Hall, 101 Warren St
on Wednesdays from 4-5pm.

For more information, or to be added to our mailing list,
please email [Robbie Lyman](mailto:robbie.lyman@rutgers.edu).

For speakers, we recommend this [short collection of guidelines](https://pages.uoregon.edu/njp/guidelines.html)
on giving a great colloquium talk.

